{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：11:17 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/1146b5a9fd3ce5900d65f31f244ff11a/2026-10/page_148.jpg\"/>\n<p>今日（18日）清晨6時10分，深水埗富昌邨富盈樓一名33歲姓黃男住戶，被家人發現在單位的房間上吊。救護員接報到場，黃男昏迷被送往明愛醫院搶救，其後不治。</p>\n<p>警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，經初步調查相信事主受財務問題困擾，在房間內以一條電線上吊，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:39:21.956990+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:17:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T05:57:40.951264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:38:11.843778+00:00","content_hash":"2197fd2ec78e64a6fe02ac1ef3562d18df3e729db228f536cc08325dc9e318a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}